── UNKNOWN NAME ──────────── E0211_null_where_a_type_is_written.lt:2:20  [E0211]

Stilt has no `null`: a value that may be missing has the type `Option<i64>`:

  2 │   let count: i64 = null
    │                    ^^^^

A value that may be missing has the type `Option<T>`: it is `None` when the
value is missing and `Some(x)` when it is there, and a `match` or an `else`
reads it.
